# UNDERDELVE: behind crystal on the altar, a stone wakes when Mo stands on it
# long enough and lowers a ladder to the canary's cage. The canary joins him
# for the fight with the Old Lode and picks off the wisps.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat give 2
cheat room 1 3 158 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 10
press B
wait 20
expect tile_11_8 == 46
cheat pos 195 130
wait 150
hold UP 150
hold RIGHT 90
expect items & 32
cheat room 7 0 60 130
expect canary == 1
